<title>UK: German inland gas oil gains, buying active.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil gains, buying active.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.8443)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     35.70/36.10     19.35/19.57   35.50/35.90</p>
<p> BREMEN		35.70/36.10     19.35/19.57   35.50/35.90</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    35.80/36.20     19.41/19.62   35.60/36.00</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   36.40/36.80     19.73/19.95   36.20/36.60</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   36.50/36.90     19.79/20.00   36.30/36.70</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  37.40/37.80     20.27/20.49   37.20/37.60</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were marked up by about 20 pfennigs in line with stronger London IPE contracts. Buyers showed better demand to try to beat further advances in screen values. -- London newsroom, +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
